<h2 class='greeting'>Hi {{username}}! 🔐</h2>

<p class='message'>
  We received a request to reset your ChatApp password. Use the OTP code below to verify your
  identity and create a new password.
</p>

<div class='otp-section'>
  <span class='otp-label'>Your password reset code:</span>
  <div class='otp-code'>{{otp}}</div>
  <p class='otp-expiry'>This code will expire in {{expiry}}</p>
</div>

<p class='message'>
  Enter this code in the password reset screen to continue. If you didn't request a password reset,
  please ignore this email and your account will remain secure.
</p>

<div class='security-note'>
  <h3>🛡️ Account Security</h3>
  <p>For your security, this code can only be used once. If you need a new code, you can request
    another password reset from the app.</p>
</div>

<a href='{{resetLink}}' class='cta-button'>Reset Your Password</a>

<div class='divider'></div>

